==Latin==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|la|trānsdūcō}}

===Etymology===
From {{affix|la|trāns-|gloss1=across, beyond|dūcō|gloss2=lead}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|trādūcō}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|irreg|trādūcō}}

# I [[lead]], [[bring]], [[transport]] or [[conduct]] across or over something.
# I [[parade]], lead along; [[make]] a [[show]] of, [[expose]] to [[public]] [[ridicule]]; [[dishonor]], [[disgrace]], [[degrade]].
# {{lb|la|figuratively}} I [[transfer]], [[convert]], [[remove]].
# {{lb|la|figuratively}} I [[exhibit]], [[display]], [[proclaim]], [[spread]] abroad, make public.
# {{lb|la|figuratively}} [[translate]] (transfer a [[word]] from one [[language]] to another)
# [[derive]] (one word from another)
# {{lb|la|figuratively|of time}} I [[spend]], [[pass]], lead.

